# Large armhf image-build inputs, regenerated only when a new armhf docker image is made.
# Ignored rather than merely untracked so `git clean -fd` cannot destroy them: after
# create_docker_image_qt6.sh stopped downloading from Cloudsmith they are the required local
# inputs for the build, and they take hours to reproduce.
